      <title>全球首个热驱动固态制冷原型机问世 废热和阳光直接变冷气</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260904/%E5%85%A8%E7%90%83%E9%A6%96%E4%B8%AA%E7%83%AD%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8%E5%9B%BA%E6%80%81%E5%88%B6%E5%86%B7%E5%8E%9F%E5%9E%8B%E6%9C%BA%E9%97%AE%E4%B8%96-%E5%BA%9F%E7%83%AD%E5%92%8C%E9%98%B3%E5%85%89%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%98%E5%86%B7%E6%B0%94/</link>
